<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Login Instructions</title>
</head>
<body>
<h2>How to Login</h2>
<p>Please enter a username and password that follow the rules below.</p>
<h3>Username Rules</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Must start with a capital letter.</li>
    <li>Must contain at least 3 characters.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Examples:</strong></p>
<ul>
    <li>Bhuvnesh</li>
    <li>Rahul</li>
    <li>Admin</li>
</ul>
<h3>Password Rules</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Must contain at least 8 characters.</li>
    <li>Must contain at least 1 uppercase letter.</li>
    <li>Must contain at least 1 number.</li>
    <li>Must contain exactly 1 special character.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Example of a valid password:</strong></p>
<code>Password1!</code>
<p>Breakdown:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>P</strong> → uppercase letter</li>
    <li><strong>assword</strong> → additional characters</li>
    <li><strong>1</strong> → number</li>
    <li><strong>!</strong> → exactly one special character</li>
</ul>

<br>

